cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or results, please cite this repository."
title: "Fused reproduction of KD-YOLOX-ViT + DCBD + ROSAR for side-scan sonar object detection"
abstract: >-
  A reproduction project that fuses three open-source side-scan sonar object
  detection methods (KD-YOLOX-ViT, DCBD and ROSAR) into a single detector and
  evaluates them with a unified protocol, including ablation, robustness and
  video-frame alignment experiments on the SWDD dataset.
authors:
